{"id":"20260825T232655.662372740Z-fb896377","time":"2026-08-25T23:26:55.66237274Z","session_id":"session-20260825T232133.663196850Z","task_id":"task-1787700093663418112","source":"sensei","kind":"change.reported","summary":"Architectural change report\n  for: internal/assist scopes its awareness_preflight call without telling Sensei which repository domain it is asking about, so the answer is not scoped to the workspace Sensei itself reported.\n\nWhen the workspace result carries a repository domain at binding.repository_domain, the preflight call must pass it as the \"domain\" argument. When no domain is available, the call must be made without a \"domain\" argument rather than with an empty one. Nothing else about the call changes.\n\n  files: 1 added, 1 modified, 0 deleted\n  go: 1 source, 1 test\n\n  governed by:\n    Assisted context and handoff packets must never claim governed admission\n    Assisted architectural context must come from Sensei and preserve its provenance\n\n  Sensei risk class: ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE\n\n  Sensei diff audit:\n    schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\n    decision: pass\n    availability: available\n    input_trust: caller_supplied\n    digest: 6128fa135c060df6731150ac75a25c1dd67f5017cccc3d4a13bc795ae94be6c8\n    changed_files_count: 2\n    findings_count: 0\n    \n    No blocking findings found in supplied diff.\n\n  not established by this report:\n    - admission: not requested, so this candidate is not admitted\n    - correctness: reviewer acceptance is not proof, and passing tests are not proof","payload":{"files":[{"path":"internal/assist/packet.go","status":"modified"},{"path":"internal/assist/packet_test.go","status":"added"}],"audit":"schema: awareness.diff_audit/v1\ndecision: pass\navailability: available\ninput_trust: caller_supplied\ndigest: 6128fa135c060df6731150ac75a25c1dd67f5017cccc3d4a13bc795ae94be6c8\nchanged_files_count: 2\nfindings_count: 0\n\nNo blocking findings found in supplied diff.","risk":"ARCHITECTURE_SENSITIVE","governing":["Assisted context and handoff packets must never claim governed admission","Assisted architectural context must come from Sensei and preserve its provenance"]}}
